      "id": "root_daily",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# 📅 2026-10-19 デイリートレンド\n\n**🔥 本日の最重要ニュース**\nLLMコンテキストの無駄を極限まで削ぎ落とす：コンテキスト圧縮ツール「Headroom」が登場\n\n[出典リンク](https://github.com/headroomlabs-ai/headroom)"
    },
    {
      "id": "entities_summary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -480,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 🏢 注目企業\n- [[Entities/Mistral|Mistral]]\n- [[Entities/GitHub|GitHub]]\n\n### ⚙️ 注目技術\n- [[Technologies/transformer|transformer]]\n- [[Technologies/LLM|LLM]]\n- [[Technologies/diffusion|diffusion]]\n- [[Technologies/RAG|RAG]]\n- [[Technologies/distillation|distillation]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "purpose_ai_research",
      "type": "text",
